│                          │ optimizes all center coordinates and individual radii under explicit border and pairwise  │
│                          │ non-overlap constraints, using several slightly perturbed feasible starts. The best       │
│                          │ result is globally rescaled by a tiny safety factor after optimization, ensuring that     │
│                          │ floating-point optimizer tolerances cannot produce an invalid packing. If SciPy is        │
│                          │ unavailable or refinement fails, the explicit 2.6 hexagonal construction remains the      │
│                          │ fallback.                                                                                 │
