│ patch_description        │ Introduce a genuinely staggered, truncated-hexagonal initialization rather than aligned   │
│                          │ rows.  Alternating row offsets give the optimizer contact graphs closer to dense          │
│                          │ triangular-lattice packing while preserving generous initial feasibility margins.  The    │
