│                          │ nearly regular and slightly asymmetric boundary configurations.                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Expand the multistart set with all placements of the six-circle row among five rows,      │
│                          │ additional six-row layered topologies, and repeated high-quality topologies with          │
│                          │ independent perturbations.  Boundary effects are important for unequal-circle optima, so  │
│                          │ these alternatives expose SLSQP to distinct local contact structures while retaining the  │
│                          │ same public interface and inexpensive analytic optimization.                              │
