│                          │ more random seeds: near an unequal-circle optimum, SLSQP can use the slack to alter wall  │
│                          │ contacts and recover the small improvements that are otherwise hidden by its feasibility  │
│                          │ tolerance.  The pool is capped to keep runtime predictable.                               │
